// # tests_x86_e2e — Mod Entry
//
// Logline: Re-exports the tests_x86_e2e test runners for toolchain consumers.
//
// Setup: Per FORMAT.oot §1.4. The test files in this directory each expose pub fn main() and cannot be co-imported here (main would collide). This mod.oo provides a count function for toolchain introspection.
